{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "return_regret_hybrid",
  "intent": "Hybrid return-aware with regret-based tie breaking. Reduces the return distance coefficient from the parent seed (0.25 to 0.15) so early-step candidates are not over-penalized on uniform instances where return geometry is uninformative, and adds a moderate regret term (0.25) so that among candidates with similar local distance the one with higher insertion regret (a clearer local winner) is preferred. Local distance remains the dominant negative signal, preserving the parent family while correcting uniform-region weakness.",
